flowchart LR
    User[Analyst / response planner] --> UI[React map interface]
    UI --> API[FastAPI service]
    API --> SAR[SAR processing]
    SAR --> GEE[Sentinel-1 via Google Earth Engine]
    SAR --> TH[Threshold methods and flood masks]
    TH --> ISO[Road-network isolation analysis]
    OSM[OpenStreetMap roads and settlements] --> ISO
    ISO --> RESULT[Flood extent and isolated settlements]
    RESULT --> API
    API --> UI
